{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: This demo features the first half of the game\u2019s opening act. If you want to see more, let us know by wishlisting the full game!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sick Samurai</strong> is a blindingly fast and bloody action game based on instant-death combat and razor-sharp reflexes. Immerse yourself in lofi hip hop and retro anime aesthetics as you embark on your journey to becoming the greatest fighter on the island - all in this fully-featured demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717520/extras/Ultracombat.gif?t=1746988565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sick Combat:</strong> Slash and dash through opponents at incredible speeds. Wield secondary weapons - like the <strong>kunai</strong> and <strong>stun bombs</strong> - and kick objects at enemies to shift the odds in your favor. When the time is right, unleash the <strong>Girameki</strong> technique. Blink, and you'll die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717520/extras/Items.gif?t=1746988565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sick Strategies:</strong>\u00a0Each of the demo's four handcrafted combat levels offers multiple paths and strategies.\u00a0You'll choose between an upgrade and a new secondary weapon as you face increasingly challenging opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717520/extras/DialogueFixedArtifacts.gif?t=1746988565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sick Storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Meet the game's main cast of fully voice-acted characters: There's\u00a0<strong>Genyu</strong>, the infamous ex-samurai who\u2019s taken you under his wing, <strong>Jones</strong>, a \u201cformer\u201d gangster turned proprietor of a jazz bar, and <strong>Spike</strong>, Jones\u2019 disagreeable Rottweiler. Shape your relationships through branching dialogue choices \u2014 and if you\u2019re persistent, uncover a couple of hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717520/extras/Vibes.gif?t=1746988565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sick Aesthetics:</strong>\u00a0This demo features 8 original tracks from Sick Samurai's lofi soundtrack. Blending the vibes of hip hop, jazz, funk, soul, and more, with hand-drawn, retro anime-style art, the world of Sick Samurai will take you back to a surreal reimagining of the golden age.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717520?t=1746988565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717520?t=1746988565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717520/4599e9fc6914ef56a8341cde8f40708344fe915d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746988565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717520/4599e9fc6914ef56a8341cde8f40708344fe915d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746988565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes depictions of violence, blood, gore, swearing, and use of alcohol and tobacco."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: This demo features the first half of the game\u2019s opening act. If you want to see more, let us know by wishlisting the full game!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragr